{"id":"23839d561ae443ff","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SAssignTuple.md","title":"SAssignTuple","display":"SAssignTuple","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SAssignTuple","parameters":["D","e","xs","ds","ee"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SAssignTuple"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>e</span><span>xs</span><span>ds</span><span>ee</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>xs</code>、<code>ds</code>、<code>ee</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SAssignTuple D e xs ds ee)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists n\n  (exists w\n    (exists m\n      (exists z\n        (exists p\n          (and\n            (@ Omega w)\n            (and\n              (@ DistinctSeq xs n)\n              (and\n                (@ SeqTo xs n w)\n                (and\n                  (@ SeqTo ds n D)\n                  (and\n                    (@ FAssign D e)\n                    (and\n                      (@ Succ n m)\n                      (and\n                        (@ Seq p m)\n                        (and\n                          (@ Num0 z)\n                          (and\n                            (@ App p z e)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App p n ee)\n                            (forall i\n                            (implies\n                            (in i n)\n                            (exists j\n                            (exists h\n                            (exists hh\n                            (exists x\n                            (exists d\n                            (and\n                            (@ Succ i j)\n                            (and (@ App p i h) (and (@ App p j hh) (and (@ App xs i x) (and (@ App ds i d) (@ Update h x d hh))))))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6512a07a03a1637\" href=\"?note=b6512a07a03a1637\" title=\"ZFC_DistinctSeq\">DistinctSeq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b1aebb86096a232a\" href=\"?note=b1aebb86096a232a\" title=\"ZFC_FAssign\">FAssign</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b43345226ad62970\" href=\"?note=b43345226ad62970\" title=\"ZFC_Update\">Update</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_Z